  "notes": "Cause code is officially TBD/provisional in FORM-366 fields; narrative describes a root cause (documentation/work-management gap) but no letter code was assigned, so cause node marked provisional per rule 4. 3HVR-FN8A is explicitly stated as 'not a component in SLCRS' but able to impact its boundary, so it is modeled as a Component involved in the event without a PART_OF edge to SLCRS. Both previous-occurrence LERs cited with unit-prefixed keys exactly as stated in narrative (2020-005-00 and 2017-001-00, prefixed with unit digit 3). ABVS (auxiliary building filtration) explicitly stated operable during the event, supporting BACKED_UP_BY edge; SLCRS itself could not achieve negative pressure so it is not modeled as a backup. Regulatory basis docs (50.67, FSAR) used as analysis-basis references supporting the low-safety-significance conclusion, linked via MITIGATED_BY to the consequence rather than the LER since they qualify the consequence severity assessment."
